{"id":"preview-examples","model":"nomic-embed-text","dim":768,"src_hash":"3582282973991449090","items":[{"page":1,"chunkIdx":0,"text":"# Preview-block worked examples\n\nFour sample pick-statement blocks for the model to imitate, varied across macrostructure types — the plain-text \"Genre: X. Macrostructure: Y. Theme: Z.\" statement SKILL.md STEP 2 requires before any code. Load this file only when picking an unusual macrostructure or custom theme and STEP 2's one-line format doesn't give enough scaffolding on its own. Most builds don't need to read this file.\n\n---\n\n*Long Document (editorial, motion-cut):*\n> **Studio · v1.0.0**\n>\n> - **Macrostructure** · Long Document\n> - **Theme** · Linen (cool slate paper · steel-blue accent · geometric sans)\n> - **Enrichment** · Tier-B hand-built SVG (a 60-line coffee bean with `@property --rise` 6 s breathing-loop)\n> - **Sections** · Masthead · Letter · Three Notes · Visit · Colophon\n> - **Motion** · breathing-loop on bean only (respects `prefers-reduced-motion`)\n> - **Slop test** · 69 / 69 ✓\n> - **Diversification** · first run for this project\n\n*Bento Grid (SaaS, motion-on):*\n> **Studio · v1.0.0**\n>\n> - **Macrostructure** · Bento Grid\n> - **Theme** · Linen (cool slate paper · steel-blue accent · geometric sans)\n> - **Enrichment** · E1 Clipped-Edge Demo Video, Tier-A CSS-art trace waterfall\n> - **Sections** · Hero · 6-tile Bento (stat · sparkline · quote · code · integrations · spotlight) · Index Footer\n> - **Motion** · counter · pricing-lift · CSS marquee on integrations strip\n> - **Slop test** · 69 / 69 ✓\n> - **Diversification** · differs from Plain on paper hue (light-cool vs pure-white) + accent (indigo vs ink-blue)\n\n*Manifesto (declarative, no enrichment):*\n> **Studio · v1.0.0**\n>\n> - **Macrostructure** · Manifesto\n> - **Theme** · Manifesto (dark · Inter Tight 900 · single red bleed)\n> - **Enrichment** · none (typography only — voice carries the brand)\n> - **Sections** · Masthead · Title · Five Declarations · Bleed Band · What We Refuse · Working Rules · Practice · Reading · Colophon\n> - **Motion** · none — typography only\n> - **Slop test** · 69 / 69 ✓\n> - **Diversification** · differs from Linen on paper band (dark vs light) + display style (display-heavy vs geometric-sans)\n\n*Custom (Coffeebox archival café):*\n> **Studio · v1.0.0**\n>\n> - **Macrostructure** · Long Document\n> - **Theme** · custom (vibe: \"archival warmth, hand-set, no varnish\" · paper oklch(94% 0.020 65) · accent oklch(58% 0.16 35) terracotta · Fraunces italic display + Source Serif 4 body)\n> - **Enrichment** · Tier-A pure-CSS coffee bean (60-line SVG, breathing-loop optional)\n> - **Sections** · Masthead · Letter · Three Notes · Visit · Colophon\n> - **Motion** · breathing-loop on bean (with reduced-motion fallback)\n> - **Slop test** · 69 / 69 ✓\n> - **Diversification** · custom axes: light / italic-serif / chromatic-terracotta — differs from previous catalog Linen on accent hue + display style","embedding":[0.3945449888706207,1.0083659887313843,-3.1686840057373047,-1.013345718383789,-0.25073134899139404,-1.0590378046035767,0.7444848418235779,0.33573949337005615,0.2963355481624603,-0.5066488981246948,0.12799546122550964,0.1865662783384323,1.7718671560287476,1.2750717401504517,0.036189332604408264,-0.5910969376564026,0.14020958542823792,-1.1890487670898438,0.8005731105804443,0.9941974878311157,-0.29741430282592773,-0.07281980663537979,-0.1733585149049759,-0.7375694513320923,1.2779731750488281,0.8575413823127747,-0.4469483494758606,0.2540912628173828,-1.315880298614502,0.23111818730831146,0.2694858908653259,-0.19352750480175018,-0.6379388570785522,-0.2839500606060028,-0.7563155889511108,-0.5241202116012573,1.7173408269882202,-0.21781496703624725,-0.1836862564086914,0.43015456199645996,0.08244067430496216,0.24533753097057343,-0.08221667259931564,-0.5093419551849365,0.841898500919342,-0.027846502140164375,1.2653261423110962,-0.05897922441363335,0.5727252960205078,-0.952372193336